<title>USA: Successories June same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Successories June same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>LOMBARD, Ill. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Successories Inc said that for the five weeks ended July 5 same-store sales rose 11 percent for company-owned locations.</p>
<p>Successories sells proprietary products for business and personal motivation through retailers and catalogs.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
